
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>โรงเรียนตัวอย่างวิทยา | เว็บไซต์ประชาสัมพันธ์</title>

<style>
:root {
  --navy: #142f5e;
  --blue: #2259ad;
  --aqua: #12a9a4;
  --bg: #f4f7fc;
  --line: #dce5f1;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: #172c4d;
  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Thonburi, sans-serif;
}
a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
button, input, textarea { font: inherit; }
button { cursor: pointer; }
.wrap {
  width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 36px));
  margin: auto;
}
header {
  background: white;
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 10;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 12px #1a355116;
}
.bar {
  min-height: 78px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 16px;
}
.brand {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  font-weight: 800;
}
.seal {
  width: 48px;
  height: 48px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  background: #e6f2ff;
  border-radius: 14px;
  font-size: 27px;
}
.brand small {
  display: block;
  color: #65758b;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 400;
}
nav {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 15px;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
}
nav a:hover { color: var(--blue); }

.hero {
  background: linear-gradient(
    115deg, #142f5e, #205bb0 62%, #10aaa5
  );
  color: white;
  padding: 74px 0 105px;
}
.hero-inner {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
  gap: 42px;
  align-items: center;
}
.eyebrow {
  color: #a7f5ef;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  font-size: 13px;
}
.hero h1 {
  font-size: clamp(32px, 4.8vw, 54px);
  line-height: 1.3;
  margin: 18px 0;
}
.hero p { color: #e4f2ff; line-height: 1.9; }
.hero-art {
  min-height: 275px;
  border: 1px solid #ffffff55;
  border-radius: 28px;
  background: #ffffff1b;
  display: grid;
  place-content: center;
  text-align: center;
  gap: 14px;
  font-size: 90px;
}
.hero-art span { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; }

.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  background: var(--blue);
  color: white;
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 11px;
  padding: 11px 19px;
  font-weight: 700;
}
.btn.light { background: white; color: var(--blue); }
.btn.secondary { background: #e9f1fc; color: #172c4d; }
.btn.danger { background: #c93852; }
.btn.small { padding: 7px 10px; font-size: 12px; }

.features {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 18px;
  margin-top: -40px;
  position: relative;
}
.feature {
  background: white;
  border-radius: 17px;
  padding: 24px;
  text-align: center;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 22px #102a4b15;
}
.feature span { font-size: 30px; }
.feature b { display: block; margin-top: 8px; }

section {
  padding: 70px 0;
  scroll-margin-top: 90px;
}
.heading { font-size: 30px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
.muted { color: #65758b; line-height: 1.8; }
.about { background: white; }
.about-inner {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 42px;
  align-items: center;
}
.illustration {
  min-height: 270px;
  border-radius: 24px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d8e9ff, #c7f5eb);
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  font-size: 95px;
}
.grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 25px;
}
.card {
  background: white;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 17px;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 15px #12325b0b;
}
.art {
  height: 150px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e1eeff, #d8f7f1);
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  font-size: 57px;
}
.card-body { padding: 20px; }
.card h3 { margin: 8px 0; }
.card p { line-height: 1.75; color: #5f7089; }
.pill {
  display: inline-block;
  background: #e8f1ff;
  color: var(--blue);
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 5px 10px;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
}
.alt { background: #eaf2fc; }
.search {
  padding: 12px 14px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 10px;
  width: min(100%, 410px);
  margin-top: 20px;
}
.contact { background: #e9f2fd; }
.admin { background: white; }
.admin-shell {
  background: #f4f7fc;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 24px;
}
.warning {
  background: #fff2d5;
  padding: 14px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  color: #76541c;
  line-height: 1.7;
}
.admin-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 22px;
  margin-top: 20px;
}
.field {
  width: 100%;
  border: 1px solid #cddbeb;
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 11px;
  margin: 7px 0 14px;
  background: white;
}
textarea.field { min-height: 115px; }
.admin-list { max-height: 440px; overflow: auto; }
.admin-row {
  padding: 12px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 12px;
}
.actions { display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: start; }
.tabs { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.empty { padding: 20px; color: #65758b; }
footer {
  background: #122c53;
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 34px;
}
footer p { color: #cad8e9; }

@media (max-width: 800px) {
  .bar { align-items: start; flex-direction: column; padding: 14px 0; }
  .hero-inner, .about-inner, .admin-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  .grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}
@media (max-width: 560px) {
  .grid, .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .features { margin-top: 18px; }
  .hero { padding: 50px 0; }
  .hero-art { min-height: 200px; }
  section { padding: 45px 0; }
  .admin-row { flex-direction: column; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<header>
  <div class="wrap bar">
    <a class="brand" href="#home">
      <span class="seal">🏫</span>
      <span>
        โรงเรียนตัวอย่างวิทยา
        <small>เรียนรู้อย่างสร้างสรรค์ ก้าวทันโลกอนาคต</small>
      </span>
    </a>
    <nav>
      <a href="#home">หน้าแรก</a>
      <a href="#about">เกี่ยวกับโรงเรียน</a>
      <a href="#news">ข่าวสาร</a>
      <a href="#events">กิจกรรม</a>
      <a href="#staff">บุคลากร</a>
      <a href="#contact">ติดต่อ</a>
      <a href="#admin">จัดการเว็บไซต์</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
<div id="home" class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-inner">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">WELCOME TO OUR SCHOOL</div>
      <h1>เรียนรู้อย่างสร้างสรรค์<br>เติบโตอย่างมีคุณภาพ</h1>
      <p>
